{"pull": {"id": "number:22752", "number": 22752, "title": "MINOR: Document connections.max.idle.ms dependency on max.poll.interval.ms for Classic consumer", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-07-03T12:55:39Z", "closed_at": "2026-07-14T16:51:29Z", "merged_at": "2026-07-14T16:51:29Z", "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "In the Classic consumer, `connections.max.idle.ms` can cause the\ncoordinator connection to be reaped during a long rebalance if\n`max.poll.interval.ms` is higher than it. When this happens, in-flight\n`JoinGroup` requests are cancelled and the group cycles through\nconnection reaping, which prolongs or destabilizes the rebalance —\nparticularly in large consumer groups where the coordinator waits longer\nfor all members to rejoin.\n\nReviewers: Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, 